                <pb facs="0105" n="15" xml:id="pg15"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.00/1695: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">White</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-07-12T12:00:00-05:29"><hi rendition="#italic">July 12,
                                1920—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 4:13 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>147. Liberal National Committee yesterday met and nominated José Miguel Gomez for
                    President. Meeting adjourned without naming vice-presidential candidate.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">White</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
